OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 43, killed in
OL,4,Athree-vehicle Borders crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old man has died in a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash in the Scottish
OL,8,FBorders.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called out to
OL,11,Fthe A6089 near Gordon at about 17:55 on
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,FThe collision involved a Ford Focus,
OL,15,FToyota Hilux and Tesla Model S.
OL,17,FThe Ford driver was pronounced dead at
OL,18,Fthe scene while the Toyota driver was
OL,19,Ftaken to the Borders General Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
